==Battleground==
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mousse (Enemy)|Mousse]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] that can outrange the enemy units here. Some examples are [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. You can then use close ranged tanky units in order to kill Mousse, like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] or [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]]. You can also use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] or [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]] to finish the stage quickly.

